  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_8": "§7Hit 6: 153.4% of Attack Power",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_9": "§aPassive – Unbound Vermilion Butterfly:",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_10": "§eIncreases maximum HP by 40% while held.",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_11": "§eAdditionally, grants Attack Power equal to 16% of the holder\u0027s maximum HP.",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_12": "§eWhen the holder’s current HP drops to 50% or below, gains an additional 18% of maximum HP as Attack Power.",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_13": "§aPassive – Hearthfire of Blood:",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_14": "§eWhen the holder’s current HP drops to 50% or below, Attack Power is increased by 33%.",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_15": "§aActive – Butterfly Brings Rebirth:",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_16": "§bRight-click to consume 30% of current HP (non-lethal) and gain the \"Butterfly Brings Rebirth\" buff for 9 seconds (16-second cooldown).",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_17": "§bThis buff increases the holder\u0027s ATK by an amount equal to 62.6% of their Max HP, but cannot exceed 800% of the holder\u0027s ATK.",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_17_5": "§bAdditionally, this buff causes the player\u0027s attacks to inflict the Blood Blossom debuff for 8 seconds.",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_17_75": "§bThe debuff deals damage every 4 seconds based on 100% of the player\u0027s Max HP + 115% of the player\u0027s current ATK.",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_f0": "§aFinisher: Spirit Soother",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_f1": "§dActivate with Sneak + Left Click, dealing 494% ATK damage and healing the player for 10.20% of their Max HP.",
  "item.everlaartifacts.homa_staff.description_f2": "§dWhen the player’s HP is below 30%, this skill instead deals 617% ATK damage and heals for 13.60% of Max HP.",
